out/
/shots/
# The COMPOSED featured images are committed: they are what the site serves,
# they are small (~40 KB avif each), and Render has no way to regenerate them
# because the capture step needs real internet. The RAW captures are inputs —
# multi-megabyte PNGs that only exist to be composited — so they stay out.
public/shots/raw/
# Retired files waiting to be removed by hand. Never part of a commit.
_to_delete/

# Raw screenshots: multi-megabyte inputs to scripts/build-featured.mjs and
# build-marquee.mjs. The composed images in public/shots are what ships.
captures/

# Private working notes, and the local list of terms the disclosure gate
# blocks (see scripts/check-content.ts). Neither belongs in a public repo.
dev/
scripts/disclosure.local.json

.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
